sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    actor ADV as Advisor (any advisor of the purpose's pool)
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as CorrectionRequestsController
    participant S as CorrectionRequestService
    participant CS as IConsentService
    participant G as IAccessGuardService
    participant K as IAttributeKeyService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Pick a value and a consent purpose, give the correct value and a reason
    W->>C: POST /api/CorrectionRequests {consentPurposeId, studentDataId, proposedValue, explanation}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Row must be the student's latest value, not missing or erased, no pending request for it
    S->>R: Purpose must be active, not the statistics purpose, cover the attribute and have an advisor policy
    S->>CS: CreateAsync(student, purpose, [attribute]) - consent on that one attribute (an existing one is kept)
    CS->>DB: INSERT CONSENTS / CONSENTHISTORIES (when new)
    S->>K: EncryptValuesAsync(currentValue, proposedValue)
    S->>R: CreateAsync(request, consentPurposeId, status = pending) - no case is opened
    R->>DB: INSERT CORRECTIONREQUESTS
    ADV->>W: Open the correction request list (separate from cases)
    W->>C: GET /api/CorrectionRequests/search?status=pending
    C->>S: SearchAsync(AdvisorId, request)
    S->>R: Pool = purposes with an active access policy for one of the advisor's roles
    S->>G: CheckAccessAsync(advisor, student, attribute, request's purpose) and LogAccessBatchAsync
    alt approve (first advisor to decide)
        W->>C: PUT /api/CorrectionRequests/{id}/approve {decisionNotes}
        C->>S: ApproveAsync(AdvisorId, Id, request)
        S->>S: Still pending, advisor in the pool, attribute still shared under the purpose
        S->>K: EncryptValuesAsync(proposed value)
        S->>R: PrepareCreate STUDENTDATA row (status = correction, same validFrom, transactionFrom = now)
        S->>R: Update request (approved, reviewedBy = this advisor, decidedAt), SaveAsync()
    else reject (first advisor to decide)
        W->>C: PUT /api/CorrectionRequests/{id}/reject {decisionNotes}
        C->>S: RejectAsync(AdvisorId, Id, request)
        S->>R: Update request (rejected, reviewedBy = this advisor, decidedAt), SaveAsync()
    end
    R->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, decision)
    C-->>W: 200 OK
